cff-version: 1.2.0
version: 1.1.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the software repository as follows."
title: "A Sharp Norm Bound for Weighted Up-Operators on the Boolean Lattice"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Gerald"  # with substantial AI assistance; see README "AI assistance"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GeWoHu/weighted-johnson-inequality"
date-released: 2026-11-01
abstract: >-
  Repository accompanying a mathematical note proving the sharp inequality
  ||U_k(a)||^2 <= k(m-k+1)/m * sum_i |a_i|^2 for weighted up-operators on
  the Boolean lattice, with equality classification, and an application to
  a squarefree arithmetic compression of a von Mangoldt operator.
keywords:
  - Boolean lattice
  - inclusion matrix
  - operator norm
  - weighted incidence operator
  - squarefree compression
